  lines:
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=15,15,1>Hey hey! Not a bad premiere!
  - "Beginner\u2019s luck."
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=5,10,3>Ooo is that a head tilt of approval I see?
  - "YOU can\u2019t SEE anything."
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=5,10,3>Cmooooon loosen up a little.
  - "<?BowleyStartShaking=5,10,3>You gotta really get into it, start using that big
    ol\u2019 brain of yours."
  - "<?BowleyStartShaking=5,10,3>Don\u2019t even get me started on how the flying
    fruit could be a metaphor for\u2026"
  - Hey.
  - That thing just appeared in my alley.
  - "I can\u2019t talk to it, move it, nothing."
  - Did it just, look at me?
  - Or did it look at you?
  - Take care of it.
